    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shefataya, muana wa Matana, Gedaliya, muana wa Pashû, Yukala, muana wa Shelemeya, ne Pashû, muana wa Malakiya, bakunvua mei akambila Yelemiya bantu bonso ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Washala mu musoko eu nealue ku muele wa nvita, ku tshiole ne ku tshihuhu; hadi waluhukamu bua kuyeye kudi Bena Kasada neikale ne muoyo, ne muoyo wandi newikale kudiye bu tshintu tshiakanyengeye mu nvita, ne yeye neikale ne muoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Bulelela, nebafile musoko eu mu bianza bia masalayi a mukelenge wa Babulona, ne yeye neaunyenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe baminyampala bakambila mukelenge ne, Tudi tukusengelela bua bashihe muntu eu, bualu bua udi utekesha maboko a bena nvita badi bashala mu musoko eu, ne maboko a bantu bakuabo bonso, habambileye mei a nunku; bualu bua muntu eu kena ukebela bantu diakalengele, kadi udi ubakebela dikenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Sedekiya wakabambila ne, Monai, yeye udi mu bianza bienu, bualu bua mukelenge kena mua kuenza bualu bua kunuhumbisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bakakuta Yelemiya, bakamuela mu dina dia mai dia Malekiya, muana wa mukelenge, diakadi mu tshiendelu tshia balami; bakahuekesha Yelemiya ku mionshi. Mu dina adi kamuakadi mai, anu bitotshi; ne Yelemiya wakabuela mu bitotshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvua Ebede-meleke, Muena Atiopa, muntu mutungula wakadi mu nsubu wa mukelenge, ne, Bakubuesha Yelemiya mu dina dia mai (mu diba adi mukelenge wakadi ushikama hehi ne Tshibi tshia Benyamina), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebede-meleke wakaluhuka mu nsubu wa mukelenge, wakambila mukelenge ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wanyi, bantu aba bakuenza bibi mu malu a onso akenzelabo Yelemiya muprofete wakuelabo mu dina; yeye udi mua kufua mu muaba udiye, bualu bua tshiole; bualu bua kakuena bidia bikuabo mu musoko eu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe mukelenge wakambila Ebede-meleke, Muena Atiopa, ne, Angatai bantu makumi asatu bua kuya nʼebe, nuhatule Yelemiya muprofete mu dina diambedi yeye kayi muanze kufua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Ebede-meleke wakaya ne bantu aba, wakabuela mu nsubu wa mukelenge wakadi muinshi mua nsubu wa tshibutshilu, wakangataku mikusu ne bilulu bisunsuke, wakabihuekeshila Yelemiya mu dina ku muonshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebede-meleke, Muena Atiopa, wakambila Yelemiya ne, Teka mikusu ei, bilulu ebi bisunsuke, muinshi mua maha ebe, uhaike mionshi ha mutu habi. Yelemiya wakenza nunku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bakakokela Yelemiya ku mionshi, bakanuihata mu dina; ne Yelemiya wakashala mu tshiendelu tshia balami ba nsubu wa lukanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Sedekiya wakatuma bantu bua kumubikila, wakakidila Yelemiya ku tshibuelelu tshisatu tshia mu nsubu wa Yehowa. Mukelenge wakambila Yelemiya ne, Nenkukonke bualu; kunsokoki bualu bumue nansha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yelemiya wakambila Sedekiya ne, binakuambilabu, kuena unshiha bulelela, anyi? Binakulesha lungenyi lua wewe kulonda, kuena ungunvuila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku mukelenge Sedekiya wakaditshiha kudi Yelemiya mu musokoko, wamba ne, Bu mudi Yehowa ne muoyo, wakutufukila muoyo wetu, tshiena nkushiha, tshiena nkufila mu bianza bia bantu aba badi bakeba muoyo webe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yelemiya wakambila Sedekiya ne, Yehowa wa misumba, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Biwaluhuka kudi baminyampala ba mukelenge wa Babulona, nebasungile muoyo webe ne kabena bosha musoko eu ne kahia; wewe newikale ne muoyo ne ba mu nsubu muebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi biwabenga kuluhuka kudi baminyampala ba mukelenge wa Babulona, nunku nenfile musoko eu mu bianza bia Bena Kasada; bobo nebawoshe ne kahia, ne wewe kuena uhanduka mu bianza biabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Sedekiya wakambila Yelemiya ne, Ndi ntshina Bena Yuda bakubuela ku luseke lua Bena Kasada, bua tshifidibu mu bianza biabo, ne bua bobo kabantshimbishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Yelemiya wakamba ne, Kabena bakufila kudibo. Ndi nkusengelela ne, Utumikile dî dia Yehowa dindi nkuambila, bua wewe wikale ne diakalengele ne bua mutshima webe wikale ne muoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biwabenga kuluhuka kudibo, edi ndî dia Yehowa diakundesheye ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mona, nebahatule bakashi bonso badi bashala mu nsubu wa mukelenge wa Yuda, nebaye nʼabo kudi baminyampala ba mukelenge wa Babulona; bakashi aba nebambe ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Sedekiya wakambila Yelemiya ne, Munga muntu kamanyi mei â, ne wewe kuena ufua nansha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi biunvua baminyampala lumu lua diyiki dianyi nʼebe, ne bialuabo kûdi bua kukuambila ne, Utuambile mei awakuambila mukelenge, ne mei akukuambila mukelenge, kutusokoki bualu, ne katuena tukushiha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu diba adi wewe ubambile ne, Nakadi nsengelela mukelenge ne kampingashi ku nsubu wa Yonatana bua meme kufuilaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe baminyampala bakalua kudi Yelemiya, bakamukonka muanda eu, ne yeye wakabambila dî bu muakadi mei onso akamuambila mukelenge. Nunku bakalekela kuakula nʼandi, bualu bua kabakunvua diyiki diandi ne mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yelemiya wakashala mu tshiendelu tshia balami ba nsubu wa lukanu tô ne ku dituku diakanyengabo Yelushalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
